    </p>

    <ul>
        <li><strong>Free and easy to use:</strong> Convert PDFs without any subscription, registration, or hidden fees.</li>
        <li><strong>Accurate data extraction:</strong> Tables, columns, and numeric values are preserved for seamless analysis.</li>
        <li><strong>Secure and private:</strong> Files are processed over a secure connection and deleted from our servers after conversion.</li>
        <li><strong>Cross-platform support:</strong> Works on Windows, Mac, Android, and iOS. Convert PDFs from any modern browser.</li>
