    <p>
        There are many PDF conversion tools available, but our solution stands out for its speed, accuracy, and simplicity:
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li><strong>Precise table extraction:</strong> Maintains row and column integrity for ready-to-use spreadsheets.</li>
        <li><strong>Fast and reliable:</strong> Converts large PDFs quickly without compromising data quality.</li>
        <li><strong>Secure and private:</strong> Files are deleted from our servers after processing, ensuring confidentiality.</li>
        <li><strong>User-friendly interface:</strong> No technical expertise required. Anyone can convert PDFs in minutes.</li>
        <li><strong>Device independence:</strong> Works on any modern browser across Windows, Mac, Android, and iOS.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
        The tool is continuously updated to support the latest PDF and Excel standards, guaranteeing smooth and accurate conversions every time.
    </p>

    <h2 class="fw-semibold mt-5">FAQ: Frequently Asked Questions About PDF to Excel Conversion</h2>

    <h4 class="fw-semibold mt-3">Q1: Is this PDF to Excel converter free?</h4>
    <p>
        Yes, our online converter is completely free. You can extract data from PDFs into Excel without any subscription or fees.
    </p>

    <h4 class="fw-semibold mt-3">Q2: Do I need to create an account?</h4>
    <p>
        No account or registration is required. Upload your PDF, convert it, and download the Excel file instantly.
    </p>

    <h4 class="fw-semibold mt-3">Q3: Can I convert PDFs on mobile devices?</h4>
    <p>
        Yes, the tool is fully responsive and works on smartphones and tablets with Android or iOS.
    </p>

    <h4 class="fw-semibold mt-3">Q4: Will my tables and formatting be preserved?</h4>
    <p>
        Yes, the converter preserves tables, columns, text alignment, and numeric data for accurate Excel spreadsheets.
    </p>

    <h4 class="fw-semibold mt-3">Q5: Can I convert scanned PDFs?</h4>
    <p>
        Yes, our tool supports scanned PDFs using OCR technology where applicable to extract data into editable Excel files.
    </p>

    <h4 class="fw-semibold mt-3">Q6: Is my data secure during conversion?</h4>
    <p>
