    </p>

    <h4 class="fw-semibold mt-3">Q7: Can I convert multiple PDFs at once?</h4>
    <p>
        The tool can handle multiple PDFs in separate sessions. Each PDF is processed individually for accuracy and speed.
    </p>

    <h4 class="fw-semibold mt-3">Q8: Can I open the Excel file without Microsoft Excel?</h4>
    <p>
        Yes, the XLSX or XLS file can be opened in Google Sheets, LibreOffice, or any Excel-compatible spreadsheet software.
    </p>

    <h2 class="fw-semibold mt-5">Conclusion</h2>

    <p>
        Extracting data from PDFs and converting it into Excel spreadsheets has never been easier. Our PDF to Excel converter provides a fast, secure, and accurate way to turn PDF tables and structured data into editable Excel files. The tool is free, browser-based, and works on any device without requiring software installation or registration.
